&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is open for candidates residing in the following US states: Texas,&amp;nbsp;Oklahoma,&amp;nbsp;Louisiana,&amp;nbsp;Arkansas,&amp;nbsp;Kansas,&amp;nbsp;Missouri,&amp;nbsp;Mississippi,&amp;nbsp;Alabama. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;The role requires travel approximately 25% of the time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
