&lt;ul style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to impact the industries that run our world: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Every phone call you answer and every email you send can affect whether truck drivers deliver goods on time and without accidents, whether students get dropped off safely from school, or whether power gets restored quickly after a natural disaster.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
