&lt;p&gt;The Commercial Customer Success team supports hundreds to thousands of customers who depend on the Samsara platform daily. This team is dedicated to equipping every customer with the necessary resources to achieve rapid value, regardless of their background or expertise.&lt;br&gt;To scale this impact, we are seeking a Digital Customer Success Manager, AI &amp;amp; Automation to be a hands-on developer responsible for designing, testing, deploying, and maintaining agentic systems to support a digital-first post-sales strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
