&lt;li&gt;Excited about solving new problems in innovative ways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly collaborative with a growth mindset.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awards for top achievement (President’s club, Winner’s circle, Top 10%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for the world of operations!&lt;/li&gt;
