&lt;p&gt;As an Installation Coordinator, you’ll be responsible for orchestrating and monitoring Samsara hardware installations across customer fleets. You will ensure that each deployment is carried out according to technical and operational standards, working closely with Implementation consultants, Account Executives, Partners, and Internal stakeholders to guarantee a successful customer experience from the start.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a critical and detail-oriented role that blends project coordination, field operations knowledge, and customer success. Your work ensures our customers’ first touchpoint with Samsara’s technology is smooth, impactful, and aligned with our quality and safety standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a remote position open to candidates residing in Mexico.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
