&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate pre-installation logistics with partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate customer and site readiness, including cable availability and configuration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the Statement of Work (SOW) is fully understood and achievable before kickoff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track real-time installation progress, ensuring adherence to the project plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify deviations from expected timelines or specifications and define/remediate action plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive weekly installation reporting cadence and provide updates to internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain installation evidence and ensure proper documentation is stored and accessible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a point of contact for escalations and troubleshooting during install phases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with Sales, Implementation, and Support to ensure alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure installation partners are trained and follow Samsara standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor CSAT related to installation events and resolve root causes of dissatisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide proactive communication and transparency with customers during install projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and continuously improve the installation coordination process using AI and Robotic Process Automation (RPA) tools to enhance efficiency and scale globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Champion, role model, and embed Samsara’s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale globally and across new offices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
