&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in field operations coordination, customer implementation, or technical deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail with the ability to manage multiple installs in parallel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in Spanish and English (verbal and written).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in a dynamic, fast-paced environment with cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ideal candidate also has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has strong bias for standardization, automation and AI, the ability to think big, with insistence on high standards.&lt;/li&gt;
