&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage team performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver results across team KPIs and org level OKRs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own executive-level stakeholder relationships and lead escalation resolution for at-risk, high-ACV accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Sales, Solutions Engineering, Support, and Customer Success to ensure seamless handoffs, and protect renewal and expansion opportunities on these accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach consultants through complex, multi-site technical implementations, including hardware deployment logistics and system/API integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement process-improvement opportunities; such as systems efficiency gains and leaning into data resulting in increased automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead from the front with a willingness to get hands dirty&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion, role model, and embed Samsara’s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale globally and across new offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, develop and lead an inclusive, engaged, and high performing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements for the role:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience managing as services team, including experience supporting complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing Enterprise (medium/high touch) accounts or account management programs. SaaS and/or IoT/hardware implementation experience preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a demanding position with high internal visibility that requires strong work ethic, prioritization, and high emotional intelligence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing escalations and executive stakeholder relationships on complex, high-value accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a customer success CRM such as Gainsight and/or PSA tool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solutions-oriented with strong problem solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort in a fast-paced, change-heavy environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong bias for action, the ability to think big, with insistence on high standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project/program management experience (PMP or similar) a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree from a 4-year institution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The compensation range shown spans approved pay zones for this role. Your primary work location determines the range applicable to you, which may be narrower than the full range displayed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
