&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re energized by our opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt; The vision we have to digitize large sectors of the global economy requires your full focus and best efforts to bring forth creative, ambitious ideas for our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to be with the best:&lt;/strong&gt; At Samsara, we win together, celebrate together and support each other. You&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;will be surrounded by a high-calibre team that will encourage you to do your best.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own cross-cutting initiatives that drive step function business &amp;amp; commercial impact for the entire Telematics business unit, working directly with the head of Telematics and with our GTM &amp;amp; field leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, scope, and incubate new product bets adjacent to our core telematics and vehicle gateway products — forming hypotheses, building business cases, and, once validated, pairing with a small engineering pods to prototype and get in front of real customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as a deep individual contributor on highly ambiguous, complex problems — this is a path for someone who wants to stay hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Champion, role model, and embed Samsara’s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale globally and across new offices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product management experience in B2B (ideally enterprise B2B), with direct, hands-on familiarity working with field, go-to-market, and sales teams, and finding product-market fit for a B2B SaaS product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of taking a product from 0 to 1 (or 1 to 10) in a B2B environment — you&#39;ve built from a blank sheet of paper, not just optimized an existing roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and business judgment — comfortable sizing a market opportunity and building a business case from first principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using AI tools to prototype and build quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No deep telematics domain expertise required — you&#39;ll build that on the job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ideal candidate also has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Former founder or other high-ownership, self-starter experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a business with some physical-world tangibility, similar to Samsara&#39;s own focus on physical operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The compensation range shown spans approved pay zones for this role. Your primary work location determines the range applicable to you, which may be narrower than the full range displayed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
