&lt;li&gt;4+ years of full-cycle recruiting experience, including hands-on sales recruiting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience sourcing, engaging, and converting passive talent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in a high-volume environment with multiple concurrent requisitions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of building trusted relationships with hiring managers and business leaders, and setting expectations clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using metrics and funnel data to drive recruiting decisions&lt;/li&gt;
