&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build features end to end, from frontend to backend, that work across our diverse customer base, from grocery delivery to oil and gas&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI with strong judgement, knowing when to build a prototype to unblock a stalled customer deal or accelerate a refactor that reduces risk of incidents in our products&lt;/li&gt;
