&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort selling a newly launched product or category where the playbook is still being written&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
